        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhuhamba eshialo obwitsa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obusoolo nobukhupani obuli mwinywe buruIanga heena? Mbula, shiburulanga mumienya chieenywe, echisoolananga mubiungo bieenywe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwikombanga, nimuranyoola ta; mwiranga, nimukhalishilwa, nimukhaywa okhunyoola; mukhupananga nimusoolana. Shimubeetsanga ninabio ta, shichila shimusabanga tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musabanga nimuranyoola ta, shichila musabanga bubii, mbu mubimalile khumienya chieenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe ababula obwisiikwa, shimumanyile mbu okhuhamba eshialo obwitsa nikhwo okhuhamba Nyasaye obusuku? Kho owenya okhuba omwitsa weshialo, yeekhola ario omusuku waNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata mukaala mbu amahandiiko kaboolanga shikhaya nikasunga kari Roho owa yamenyia mwifwe akhwikombela amakhuwa shinga oukhutiiliilwe imbalikha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa akhushilaasilinjia obukoosia. Niko akachila nikasunga mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumuhulilenje Nyasaye; ne mumufukule Setani, naye alamwilukha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sitenje ahambi khuNyasaye, naye alamusitilanga ahambi. Labie amakhono keenywe, inywe aboonooni; siiye emioyo chieenywe, inywe abeshikhabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubeelele, nimwikhuula, nimulila; okhutsekha khweenywe khukwe tsinzikhuulu, obusangaali bweenywe nabwo bukwe eshibeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwituutuyie imbeli wOmwami, naye alamuchinguula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khuleshe okhumoonyananga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana beefwe, muramoonyananga ta. Oumoonyanga omwana wabwe, kata ouyaasia omwana wabwe eshiina, afukula amalako, khandi ayaasia amalako. Ne noba noyaasia amalako, shioba omukholi wamalako ta, habula omuyaasii wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliho mulala yenyene ouli omuhani wamalako khandi omuyaasii; ne niye ounyala okhuhonia kata okhumulala. Ne niwe wina, ouyaasia owashio?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oreeyitsialila akamukamba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhali murie, inywe ababoolanga muri Leelo luno, kata mbu Mukamba, nakhutsie mwitookho nabulebe, nikhumalayo omuyika, nikhukhola akobukhala, nikhunyoola amameeto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebutswa shimumanyilekhwo akeetsa okhubaho mukamba ta. Obulamu bweenywe bukhali burie? Shichila muli butswa linang'ong'we, elilolekhangakhwo eshise, mana likhamuulukha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakhabeele nimukhoyile okhuboola mbu Omwami naba nachama, nakhube mwoyo, nikhukhola likhuwa lino, kata elo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa bulaano mwiyitsialila obwichinjimisii bweenywe; ne obwiyitsiali bwosi obufwana burio nobubii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho oumanyile okhukhola amalayi ne narakakhola ta, khuye nobwonooni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
